<http://data.silknow.org/object/2b399cdd-1914-3304-9289-22e8970edb6a>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Linen; square in the middle, in the center of which is embroidered \"I.H.S.\" and an anchor and a cross.  On each side oblong spaces filled with drawn-work. Borders of many designs and stitches. Colors, white, yellow, green and blue. Stained. Stitches include Algerian eye, bullion, cable chain, counted satin, cross stitch variation (double twist, double running, eyelet, fern, long-armed cross, padded satin, running, twisted lattice; cutwork"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c608d47b-b95a-38f9-a251-bbf453bd5e0a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/658cf5c0-2c26-3a17-93c5-fa0fce519372> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Linen; square in the middle, in the center of which is embroidered \"I.H.S.\" and an anchor and a cross.  On each side oblong spaces filled with drawn-work. Borders of many designs and stitches. Colors, white, yellow, green and blue. Stained. Stitches include Algerian eye, bullion, cable chain, counted satin, cross stitch variation (double twist, double running, eyelet, fern, long-armed cross, padded satin, running, twisted lattice; cutwork"@en ;
